## Data Encryption

- Use SQLCipher for local database
- Encrypt all personal relationship data
- Apply AES-256 encryption standards
- Store encryption keys securely
- Never store plaintext personal data
- Use @lib/core/security/encryption_service.dart
- Implement key rotation patterns

```dart
// SQLCipher database encryption
class SecureDatabase {
  static const String _encryptionKey = 'monica_secure_key';

  Future<Database> openSecureDB() async {
    return await openDatabase(
      path,
      password: _encryptionKey,
      version: 1,
    );
  }
}
```

